WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:30.083
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:31.416
Lord Krishna clarified

3
00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:34.958
that both the path of devotion
to the personal form and

4
00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:37.583
meditation on the formless are successful.

5
00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:41.083
But He also explained

6
00:00:41.083 --> 00:00:43.208
that the path of devotion to the personal form

7
00:00:43.208 --> 00:00:44.916
is more joyful,

8
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.583
offering the experience of personal

9
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.458
love with Lord Krishna.

10
00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:51.625
And while seekers of the formless too,

11
00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:55.791
ultimately attain Lord Krishna's
Brahman nature.

12
00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:59.750
But yes, this path is extremely difficult.

13
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:03.083
And why this path is difficult, its explanation

14
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:05.000
is now in this verse.

15
00:01:09.666 --> 00:01:11.166
Lord Krishna says

16
00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:12.750
that seekers who fix their attention

17
00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.541
on His unmanifest, formless nature

18
00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:19.208
face many difficulties on this path

19
00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:22.166
of self-realisation.

20
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:23.416
This is because

21
00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.083
attaining such an unmanifest and attribute-free

22
00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:29.333
nature is very difficult for an
ordinary

23
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:31.291
embodied human being.

24
00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.208
This is important to understand.

25
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.958
Lord Krishna here uses two words:

26
00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:39.708
klesha, meaning struggle and sorrow.

27
00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:41.541
And duhkham, meaning suffering.

28
00:01:41.541 --> 00:01:44.166
Both these words clearly convey the difficulty

29
00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:48.083
of the path of formless practice.

30
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:52.166
Seekers devoted only to the formless practice,

31
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:55.000
their path is hard, because

32
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.833
like all of us,

33
00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:59.458
they too are embodied beings.

34
00:01:59.458 --> 00:02:00.833
Embodied beings

35
00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:04.291
live in this world through the senses.

36
00:02:04.291 --> 00:02:07.208
Actions, relationships, emotions,

37
00:02:07.208 --> 00:02:10.333
food, breath, everything is manifest.

38
00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:12.625
Everything can be experienced,

39
00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:14.666
can be touched.

40
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:17.833
In such a context, fixing the mind on a reality

41
00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:21.416
that has no form, no quality, no divine play,

42
00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:23.666
that cannot be touched,

43
00:02:23.666 --> 00:02:26.041
nor even imagined.

44
00:02:26.041 --> 00:02:30.208
All this goes against a human
being's natural tendency.

45
00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:31.500
Lord Krishna

46
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.250
uses the word klesha'dhikatara,

47
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:38.708
which shows that this path
is not merely difficult,

48
00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:42.458
but far more difficult than devotion.

49
00:02:42.458 --> 00:02:45.250
The human mind is naturally restless.

50
00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:47.083
So to force that mind,

51
00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:48.458
separate it from the senses,

52
00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:50.750
and keep it steady in an attribute-free reality,

53
00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:56.041
this is like trying to stop the flow of a great river.

54
00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:59.916
Avyakta hi gatir duhkham. Lord Krishna says

55
00:02:59.916 --> 00:03:02.583
that this path is filled with suffering.

56
00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:05.166
A devotee who contemplates
Lord Krishna's personal form,

57
00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:08.041
His divine plays and qualities,

58
00:03:08.041 --> 00:03:11.125
for them, even austerity becomes sweet,

59
00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:12.500
because their heart

60
00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.541
is immersed in Lord Krishna's love.

61
00:03:15.541 --> 00:03:18.583
But the seeker of the formless has neither

62
00:03:18.583 --> 00:03:21.875
an image, nor any divine play to contemplate.

63
00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:25.333
So their practice, deprived of
this sweet nectar of love,

64
00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:28.500
remains so, and for this very reason, gradually

65
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.750
this path is tiring,

66
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.416
it is discouraging.

67
00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:34.041
The being who has spent countless births

68
00:03:34.041 --> 00:03:37.458
engaged in worldly relationships and actions

69
00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:40.291
for them, fixing the mind on a formless reality

70
00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:43.583
goes completely against the nature of the mind.

71
00:03:43.583 --> 00:03:46.916
In contrast, Lord Krishna's personal form,

72
00:03:46.916 --> 00:03:48.000
endowed with beauty, qualities,

73
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.625
and divine plays,

74
00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:52.500
naturally attracts the mind

75
00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.583
and makes spiritual practice joyful.

76
00:03:55.583 --> 00:03:58.500
In essence, Lord Krishna makes clear

77
00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.416
that yes,

78
00:03:59.416 --> 00:04:02.250
reaching Him through the formless path

79
00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:06.250
is possible, but this journey is extremely difficult

80
00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:10.583
and remains deprived of the sweet
experiences of devotion.

81
00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:12.916
In the coming verses, He will explain

82
00:04:12.916 --> 00:04:16.791
how the path of devotion is the most natural,

83
00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:19.916
simple, and meaningful.

84
00:04:24.291 --> 00:04:27.833
When you want to achieve a goal,

85
00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:31.416
your commitment

86
00:04:31.416 --> 00:04:35.416
and firm resolve are absolutely essential.

87
00:04:35.416 --> 00:04:37.916
But difficult times

88
00:04:37.916 --> 00:04:40.916
come on every path.

89
00:04:40.916 --> 00:04:43.916
And in such times, what keeps

90
00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:48.625
your enthusiasm from falling is

91
00:04:48.625 --> 00:04:54.000
your emotional connection with that goal.

92
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.041
If there is no joy in that connection,

93
00:04:58.041 --> 00:05:00.833
only resolve,

94
00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:04.916
no satisfaction, only determination,

95
00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:07.500
progress will certainly come.

96
00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:11.166
But every thorn on that path

97
00:05:11.166 --> 00:05:13.791
will cut more deeply.

98
00:05:13.791 --> 00:05:16.958
Like the journey of those seekers

99
00:05:16.958 --> 00:05:19.958
who practise only My unmanifest,

100
00:05:19.958 --> 00:05:23.666
formless nature.

101
00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:27.125
I told Arjun the same thing,

102
00:05:27.125 --> 00:05:31.125
that success on the formless path is possible,

103
00:05:31.125 --> 00:05:34.125
but that path is difficult,

104
00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:38.250
because it has no bond of love,

105
00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.625
no sweetness.

106
00:05:40.625 --> 00:05:42.291
This same thing

107
00:05:42.291 --> 00:05:44.458
is equally fitting on the path

108
00:05:44.458 --> 00:05:46.291
of personal goals.

109
00:05:46.291 --> 00:05:49.500
Whether you wish to gain anything,

110
00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:53.041
some new knowledge, some new art,

111
00:05:53.041 --> 00:05:54.083
some other goal,

112
00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:58.333
or even spiritual practice itself.

113
00:05:58.333 --> 00:06:02.583
If you remain emotionally connected,

114
00:06:02.583 --> 00:06:06.875
your enthusiasm will not break
even in difficulties.

115
00:06:06.875 --> 00:06:09.708
When your heart is engaged,

116
00:06:09.708 --> 00:06:14.458
solutions to every challenge will seem simple.

117
00:06:14.458 --> 00:06:17.000
What you are doing,

118
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.583
if you love it,

119
00:06:20.583 --> 00:06:24.750
then even problems will excite you.

120
00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.541
Solving them will bring joy.

121
00:06:28.541 --> 00:06:32.041
But if your heart

122
00:06:32.041 --> 00:06:35.333
is not bound to that goal, then even small

123
00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:40.458
obstacles will feel like a burden.

124
00:06:40.458 --> 00:06:44.208
Think about this with one example.

125
00:06:44.208 --> 00:06:47.250
Tell me, who will go further?

126
00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.583
The child who is learning music only

127
00:06:50.583 --> 00:06:54.083
to win a competition,

128
00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:57.500
or the one whose heart

129
00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:01.291
holds a true love for music?

130
00:07:01.291 --> 00:07:04.375
So ask yourself,

131
00:07:04.375 --> 00:07:06.958
do you have in your heart

132
00:07:06.958 --> 00:07:11.916
only a desire to achieve the goal, or is

133
00:07:11.916 --> 00:07:14.958
simply walking on that path itself

134
00:07:14.958 --> 00:07:18.333
not joyful for you?

135
00:07:18.333 --> 00:07:21.458
And then find out how you can bring your heart

136
00:07:21.458 --> 00:07:25.458
into that path.

137
00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:28.291
When there is surrender from the heart,

138
00:07:28.291 --> 00:07:32.750
no journey will feel like a burden.

139
00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:36.416
Every step will be filled with joy.

140
00:07:41.166 --> 00:07:42.958
Study feels

141
00:07:42.958 --> 00:07:47.541
more difficult for children when they cannot form

142
00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:52.166
an emotional connection with that knowledge.

143
00:07:52.166 --> 00:07:55.708
There is no lack of intelligence here,

144
00:07:55.708 --> 00:07:58.375
there is a lack of connection,

145
00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:01.458
because in the subject or skill

146
00:08:01.458 --> 00:08:03.166
where they have interest,

147
00:08:03.166 --> 00:08:06.208
that child will certainly excel.

148
00:08:06.208 --> 00:08:08.333
Just as

149
00:08:08.333 --> 00:08:11.208
I told Arjun,

150
00:08:11.208 --> 00:08:12.958
the formless path

151
00:08:12.958 --> 00:08:15.625
feels harsh for this very reason,

152
00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:17.500
because in it

153
00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:20.750
there is neither the sweetness of affection,

154
00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.708
nor the cool touch of love.

155
00:08:23.708 --> 00:08:26.583
In the same way, a child too,

156
00:08:26.583 --> 00:08:29.458
when they experience no joy

157
00:08:29.458 --> 00:08:33.333
or love in their studies, then they

158
00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:36.833
face a difficult struggle.

159
00:08:36.833 --> 00:08:42.250
But if a subject is made interesting,

160
00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.541
and enthusiasm is awakened in learning,

161
00:08:45.541 --> 00:08:49.041
then the struggle lessens.

162
00:08:49.041 --> 00:08:52.333
And a willingness arises on its own.

163
00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:54.083
To learn,

164
00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:57.333
to make a better effort.

165
00:08:57.333 --> 00:08:59.208
This same thing holds true

166
00:08:59.208 --> 00:09:02.583
for family relationships too.

167
00:09:02.583 --> 00:09:07.375
If mutual relationships become only a duty,

168
00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:11.541
if love and a sense of belonging
no longer remain in them,

169
00:09:11.541 --> 00:09:14.833
then they grow weak.

170
00:09:14.833 --> 00:09:17.666
In such a case, even a small disagreement

171
00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:22.208
does not take long to become a big conflict.

172
00:09:22.208 --> 00:09:25.083
But if in relationships

173
00:09:25.083 --> 00:09:30.083
there is affection, there is respect,
then those same relationships

174
00:09:30.083 --> 00:09:33.833
can weather even the greatest storm.

175
00:09:33.833 --> 00:09:35.541
So simply

176
00:09:35.541 --> 00:09:37.375
keep watering love

177
00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:40.083
in your mutual relationships.

178
00:09:40.083 --> 00:09:44.125
And if this love has faded somewhere,

179
00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:46.875
revive it again.

180
00:09:46.875 --> 00:09:51.416
Remember, love has not disappeared,

181
00:09:51.416 --> 00:09:55.666
only the dust of time has settled over it.

182
00:09:55.666 --> 00:09:57.500
And yes,

183
00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.208
help your children

184
00:09:59.208 --> 00:10:03.166
find joy in their studies.

185
00:10:03.166 --> 00:10:04.250
And also,

186
00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:08.083
in the subjects or activities
where they have true interest,

187
00:10:08.083 --> 00:10:11.750
keep their enthusiasm alive in those too.

188
00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.666
Love is the power

189
00:10:13.666 --> 00:10:17.250
that makes every journey joyful.

190
00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:21.250
Whether it is studies, relationships,

191
00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:24.333
or any other aspect of life.

192
00:10:29.125 --> 00:10:32.958
The path of formless practice is difficult,

193
00:10:32.958 --> 00:10:38.250
because even imagining that
formless is not possible.

194
00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.541
And if imagination itself is not possible,

195
00:10:41.541 --> 00:10:44.791
then neither will finding it be simple,

196
00:10:44.791 --> 00:10:49.375
nor forming an emotional connection with it.

197
00:10:49.375 --> 00:10:53.750
In professional life too, a person wanders,

198
00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.000
remains dissatisfied,

199
00:10:56.000 --> 00:11:00.416
and usually there are only two reasons for this.

200
00:11:00.416 --> 00:11:03.375
First, that they have not clearly

201
00:11:03.375 --> 00:11:07.250
imagined the goal. And second,

202
00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.833
that even if the goal is clear,

203
00:11:09.833 --> 00:11:12.583
its foundation is not love,

204
00:11:12.583 --> 00:11:15.416
but competition.

205
00:11:15.416 --> 00:11:19.583
In such a case, a person either loses their way,

206
00:11:19.583 --> 00:11:23.333
or becomes discouraged while walking it.

207
00:11:23.333 --> 00:11:26.541
Now think, if the goal is clear,

208
00:11:26.541 --> 00:11:29.416
and its foundation is not competition, but

209
00:11:29.416 --> 00:11:33.750
love for that goal and that path,

210
00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.000
then?

211
00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:40.250
An extraordinary energy will awaken within.

212
00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:43.916
Then no challenge will feel too great.

213
00:11:43.916 --> 00:11:47.750
You will not tire of making the effort.

214
00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:49.041
This thing

215
00:11:49.041 --> 00:11:53.916
is fitting for personal goals too.

216
00:11:53.916 --> 00:11:55.625
But if you

217
00:11:55.625 --> 00:11:57.958
lead others,

218
00:11:57.958 --> 00:12:00.750
then too you must understand this.

219
00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:02.708
In that case, your responsibility is

220
00:12:02.708 --> 00:12:05.458
to understand where people's interests,

221
00:12:05.458 --> 00:12:06.625
their aspirations,

222
00:12:06.625 --> 00:12:09.458
their skills lie,

223
00:12:09.458 --> 00:12:11.875
and then accordingly assign them

224
00:12:11.875 --> 00:12:13.666
the right goals.

225
00:12:13.666 --> 00:12:17.166
Doing this, they will connect emotionally

226
00:12:17.166 --> 00:12:19.833
with their work.

227
00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:22.083
And when everyone moves forward together

228
00:12:22.083 --> 00:12:25.750
with such energy,

229
00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:29.166
then your group's

230
00:12:29.166 --> 00:12:34.208
and the entire organisation's success
is certainly assured.
